@startuml component-diagram-medium
title Distributed Batch Processing Platform \n Medium Detail Component Diagram

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam wrapWidth 200

[Frontend App\n(React + Vite + Recharts,\nUpload / Jobs / Metrics UI)] as Frontend

package "Backend (FastAPI, uvicorn @ localhost:8000)" {
  [Backend API\n(jobs + metrics routers,\n/api/health)] as API
  [Job Orchestration Service\n(job_service, partitioner, aggregator)] as JobOrch
  [Kubernetes Integration\n(client, job_builder,\norchestrator, watcher)] as K8sIntegration
  [Metrics Service] as MetricsSvc
}

database "SQLite DB\n(job metadata)" as DB
folder "Filesystem Storage\n(input/chunks/results/output/timings)" as FS
folder "Sweep Result CSVs" as SweepCSVs

cloud "Kubernetes Cluster (minikube)" {
  [Job\n(Indexed completion)\n+ Worker Pods] as K8sJobPods
}

component "Worker Image\n(worker/main.py,\nbatch-worker:latest)" as WorkerImage
component "minikube mount\n(9p bridge)" as Mount

Frontend --> API : HTTP/JSON REST\n(poll every 3s, CORS)

API --> JobOrch
API --> MetricsSvc

JobOrch --> DB : job metadata &\nstatus reconciliation
JobOrch --> FS : partition input /\naggregate results
JobOrch --> K8sIntegration : submit job,\nreconcile status

K8sIntegration --> K8sJobPods : Kubernetes API\n(submit / watch / delete)

K8sJobPods --> WorkerImage : runs N pods

WorkerImage --> Mount : read chunk /\nwrite result + timing
Mount --> FS : hostPath volume

MetricsSvc --> SweepCSVs : read benchmark CSVs

@enduml
